   Bars are real buttons (one per decade) in a toolbar pattern: Tab reaches the
   chart once, ArrowLeft/Right/Home/End move between decades, Enter filters.
   Height is the share of the busiest decade, so 0-record decades keep a 2px
   baseline and stay focusable. */
.zh-histogram {

